  "protocol": "Use existing unscaled float32 per-articulation Cholesky as a preconditioner, with exactly one residual correction. Residual action uses float32 Jfree*(M*(Jfree.T*x))+Gfree*x, avoiding the rounded assembled normal matrix. Factors, source operators, RHS, action, solve and update are float32. Identical 24 seeded reduced states plus both reference endpoints; unchanged normalized original free residual and recovered velocity error <=1e-5. Original float64 RHS formation is cast once; this checks inverse action only, not a complete float32 solver. No iteration or precision tuning if it fails. Save original and corrected errors per case. If it passes, separately check full float32 RHS construction before GPU adoption.\n",
  "sources": {
    "run.py": "from pathlib import Path\nimport numpy as np,json\np=Path(__file__).resolve().parent\nsource=(p.parent/'rain-articulation-factorization/run.py').read_text().split('rng=np.random.default_rng')[0]\nexec(compile(source,str(p/'setup-factorization.py'),'exec'))\nJ=m.J[r.free].astype(np.float32);M=m.M.astype(np.float32);G=m.G[np.ix_(r.free,r.free)].astype(np.float32)\ndef action(x):\n assert x.dtype==np.float32\n out=J@(M@(J.T@x))+G@x;assert out.dtype==np.float32;return out\nrng=np.random.default_rng(20261006);cases=[('random-'+str(i),rng.normal(size=r.N)) for i in range(24)]\nfor arm in ['cold','capped']:cases.append((arm,np.load(p.parent/'rain-interior-global-budget'/(arm+'.npz'))['impulses'][r.remaining]))\nrecords=[]\nfor name,y in cases:\n rhs=-(m.g[r.free]+r.Hfr@y);want=r.recover(y);vref=m.M@m.J.T@want;xf=solve(rhs,'float32').astype(np.float32)\n for stage in ['original','one-correction']:\n  if stage=='one-correction':\n   residual=rhs.astype(np.float32)-action(xf);xf+=solve(residual,'float32').astype(np.float32)\n  x=want.copy();x[r.free]=xf;res=float(max(abs(r.Hff@x[r.free]-rhs)/(1+abs(rhs))));v=m.M@m.J.T@x;verr=float(max(abs(v-vref)/(1+abs(vref))));records.append(dict(case=name,stage=stage,free_residual=res,velocity_difference=verr,pass_screen=res<=1e-5 and verr<=1e-5))\nsummary={stage:dict(failed=sum(v['stage']==stage and not v['pass_screen'] for v in records),max_free_residual=max(v['free_residual'] for v in records if v['stage']==stage),max_velocity_difference=max(v['velocity_difference'] for v in records if v['stage']==stage)) for stage in ['original','one-correction']}\nresult=dict(status='correction-pass' if not summary['one-correction']['failed'] else 'correction-failed',summary=summary,records=records)\n(p/'result.json').write_text(json.dumps(result,indent=2));print(json.dumps(summary,indent=2))\n"
  },
